        <div class="section-intro"><p class="eyebrow">What the website needs to do</p><h2>Make important information easier to find and trust</h2><p>A charity website may need to serve supporters, service users, funders, volunteers and trustees at the same time. Strong structure matters more than visual novelty.</p></div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
