<section class="section-padding-lg bg-bg-primary dark:bg-bg-primary-dark">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Choose the right support model</p><h2>Built upfront, then supported in the way that fits</h2><p>Charities can use the same core service routes as other clients, with the scope adapted to their audiences and governance needs.</p></div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            <article class="decision-card"><h3>Managed subscription</h3><p>Suitable when you want hosting, maintenance, direct support and reasonable updates to existing pages included.</p></article>
            <article class="decision-card"><h3>Managed growth</h3><p>Suitable when your team can supply useful articles and wants help structuring, publishing and reviewing them.</p></article>
            <article class="decision-card"><h3>One-off build</h3><p>Suitable when the organisation prefers a project fee and can arrange hosting and future updates separately.</p></article>
